# Hidden setup, sourced by each tape after its Set commands: move into the
# demo folder and use a plain prompt. scripts/render-gifs.sh sets
# CUDDIO_DEMO to a copy of examples/ and puts a freshly built cuddio on PATH.
Hide
Type `cd "$CUDDIO_DEMO" && export PS1='\[\e[38;2;166;227;161m\]$\[\e[0m\] ' && clear`
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
